{"page":172,"width":1745,"height":2465,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"중위 순회","words":[{"text":"중위","x":199,"y":207,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"순회","x":283,"y":207,"width":69,"height":38}]},{"text":"중위 순회는 (1) 왼쪽 하위 트리부터 시작해서 (2) 뿌리를 거쳐 (3) 오른쪽 하위 트리를 방문하는","words":[{"text":"중위","x":200,"y":287,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"순회는","x":278,"y":287,"width":101,"height":33},{"text":"(1)","x":395,"y":286,"width":50,"height":35},{"text":"왼쪽","x":461,"y":288,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"하위","x":537,"y":288,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"트리부터","x":611,"y":287,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"시작해서","x":745,"y":286,"width":114,"height":35},{"text":"(2)","x":877,"y":285,"width":42,"height":35},{"text":"뿌리를","x":933,"y":286,"width":87,"height":34},{"text":"거쳐","x":1030,"y":285,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"(3)","x":1102,"y":283,"width":44,"height":36},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1160,"y":285,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"하위","x":1259,"y":283,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"트리를","x":1330,"y":282,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"방문하는","x":1441,"y":280,"width":145,"height":37}]},{"text":"방법입니다. 왜 노드가 아닌 하위 트리부터 방문하는 것일까요? 트리가 하위 트리의 집합이라고 가","words":[{"text":"방법입니다.","x":201,"y":350,"width":172,"height":35},{"text":"왜","x":389,"y":351,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"노드가","x":434,"y":352,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"아닌","x":543,"y":352,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"하위","x":618,"y":353,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"트리부터","x":690,"y":352,"width":117,"height":34},{"text":"방문하는","x":822,"y":350,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"것일까요?","x":949,"y":350,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"트리가","x":1090,"y":348,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"하위","x":1188,"y":348,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"트리의","x":1259,"y":348,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"집합이라고","x":1364,"y":346,"width":172,"height":36},{"text":"가","x":1548,"y":345,"width":38,"height":34}]},{"text":"정하면 하위 트리 역시 또 다른 하위 트리의 집합이라고 할 수 있습니다. 하위 트리가 또 다른 하위 트","words":[{"text":"정하면","x":203,"y":416,"width":95